  "description": "Summer Operating Area: Naples/Sicily, Riviera/Corsica/Sardinia, Spain/Balearics, French Polynesia\nWinter Operating Area: Caribbean Virgin Islands (US/BVI), Bahamas, Caribbean Leewards, Caribbean Windwards\n\nYCM FIFTY (former High Occupancy) is a 50.29m / 165ft Luxury Motor Superyacht built in 1989 by Oceanfast and later underwent a refit in 2024. Sleeping 12 guests in 6 cabins and with a crew of 9. Cruising at 12.00 kn/ph with a top speed of 30.00 kn/ph. The guest cabins comprise 3 cabins with a king size bed, and 3 cabins with a queen size bed, all with en-suite bathroom facilities.\n",
